# Golden vectors for node/notes_local.situ, written by hand from the layout
# in its header comment, so the description is held to a writer other than its
# compiler. 0x08 is FZN_CMD_NOTES (8); the op is the SUBCMD, 128 (0x80) on.

message notes_own      08 80 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB AB
